Cell[TextData[{
 " r<s case, A1 and B1 are general multivectors. We need grade-r and grade-s \
blades only. Take r=2 and s=3, then r(r-s)=-2 and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox[
